### Registro de dispositivo Jobs con datos completos — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/registration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "Juan Perez - iPhone",
  "serialNumber": "ABC123XYZ789",
  "osId": 2,
  "osVersion": "17.4",
  "deviceManufacturer": "Apple",
  "deviceModel": "iPhone 15",
  "phoneNumber": "+50212345678"
}

### Registro mínimo (solo campos requeridos) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/registration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "Pedro Lopez - Android",
  "serialNumber": "SN-ANDROID-0002"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "Juan Perez - iPhone",
  "serialNumber": "ABC123XYZ789"
}

### Sin serialNumber (campo requerido faltante) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/registration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "Juan Perez - iPhone"
}

### unitName vacío (solo espacios) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/registration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "   ",
  "serialNumber": "ABC123XYZ789"
}
